Package: myphotodiary-frontend
Version: [[version]]-1
Section: web
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Recommends: caddy | apache2 | nginx-full | nginx-light | nginx
Maintainer: Marc Lamberton <321042643+marc-mada@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: myPhotoDiary frontend (static build)
 Static React/Vite build for the myPhotoDiary family photo/video diary -
 installs to /opt/myphotodiary/frontend-dist. Meant to be served by a
 web server (Caddy recommended) that also forwards /api to the separate
 myphotodiary-backend package's own service - this package carries no
 server of its own.
